  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Acceso a la Electrificacin Rural (PAER)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Electrification Access Program (PAER)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es aumentar la cobertura elctrica en zonas rurales. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) incrementar el nmero de usuarios con acceso al servicio de energa elctrica en zonas rurales; y (ii) fortalecer la capacidad institucional para la planificacin, diseo yo gestin de proyectos de electrificacin rural.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the Program is to increase electricity coverage in rural areas. The specific objectives are: (i) to increase the number of users with access to electricity service in rural areas; and (ii) to strengthen institutional capacity for planning, design andor management of rural electrification projects.</narrative>
  </description>
